     6	def unique_digits(x):
     7	    """Given a list of positive integers x. return a sorted list of all 
     8	    elements that hasn't any even digit.
     9	
    10	    Note: Returned list should be sorted in increasing order.
    11	    
    12	    For example:
    13	    >>> unique_digits([15, 33, 1422, 1])
    14	    [1, 15, 33]
    15	    >>> unique_digits([152, 323, 1422, 10])
    16	    []
