   133	### Supplied trusted primitive
   134	
   135	`sortVS` is a **trusted primitive** supplied by
   136	`reference-semantics/semantics/sort.k`. Under symbolic proof it denotes the
   137	ascending permutation of an integer `ValSeq`; under LLVM `krun` it executes the
   138	supplied insertion-sort equations. It affects the final heap order but not
