+| Definition | Source/main module | Backend | Result |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `runtime-fresh-kompiled` | supplied `semantics.k` / `MPY-KRUN` | LLVM | exit 0 |
+| `connection-fresh-kompiled` | `connection-verification.k` / `CONNECTION-VERIFICATION` | Haskell | exit 0 |
