Audit complete.

- Verdict: `CONCERNS / LEGIT`
- Main concern: symbolic sorting relies on the supplied opaque `sortVS` contract; the decimal-digit interpretation also remains an informal arithmetic bridge.
- All fresh proof suites closed with `#Top`; independent false-result and body mutations failed as expected.

